# Baseline .config fragment for Xiaomi CR8808 M81 (256m group)
#
# This is a FRAGMENT, not a full .config. The workflow copies it to .config
# and runs `make defconfig`, which expands it against the kuncy7 tree
# (openwrt-nss-edma, branch c3po-tag-8021q, kernel 6.18).
#
# Symbol names below come from the project research report (base-source
# recommendation section). The workflow greps the expanded .config after
# defconfig and fails the build if a required symbol was dropped, so a
# wrong symbol name fails loudly instead of silently producing a
# non-NSS image.
#
# Device: Xiaomi CR8808, M81 board revision (A版), IPQ5018 + QCN6122 + QCA8337,
# Board data: NOT from an ipq-wifi package (none exists for M81). It comes
# from the per-device files overlay files-xiaomi_cr8808/
# (lib/firmware/ath11k/IPQ5018/hw1.0/board-2.bin and
# lib/firmware/ath11k/QCN6122/hw1.0/board-2.bin, CTR66266 2.4 GHz FEM),
# fetched by the workflow at build time from hzyitc's redmi_ax3000
# board files (pinned commit + sha256 check).

# 256 MB RAM -> 256m group: ath11k 256M profile, NSS low memory profile.
# Linux sees about 169 MiB on this board with 20-30 MiB free at idle,
# so keep the package set small.

# Target: qualcommax/ipq50xx, device profile xiaomi_cr8808 (custom device, injected into the base tree at build time; see dts/)
CONFIG_TARGET_qualcommax_ipq50xx_DEVICE_xiaomi_cr8808=y
